<TXSPN>Akane Kogori is the culprit, you say.<PG>
I see: if it was Akane Kogori who killed Ryoji Kogori, which set everything off in the first place, then the matter of the Hokkaido business trip and the actions on April 8 are puzzling in many ways.<PG>
And at the end, Akane Kogori had been killed too, but the reason she would be killed is also unclear. Perhaps it was suicide.<PG>
The theory that Akane Kogori is the culprit, it is quite interesting.<PG>
